{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06NY", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0b63e8cd3c00e658c8b4ba9520ae0a1828ffe289c8b07ebce279305733e5848a", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nGerbes are a special kind of stacks in groupoids.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:cd8c9e4e9b0a3aa147ff2f8566a2cb2ecbb5d008d65f9ea14cbbf0bc438fef5b", "unit_id": "tag:06NY:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "06NY", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$p : \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0004": "$p : \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0006": "$U \\in \\Ob(\\mathcal{C})$", "MATH_0007": "$\\{U_i \\to U\\}$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{S}_{U_i}$", "MATH_0010": "$U \\in \\Ob(\\mathcal{C})$", "MATH_0011": "$x, y \\in \\Ob(\\mathcal{S}_U)$", "MATH_0012": "$\\{U_i \\to U\\}$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0014": "$x|_{U_i} \\cong y|_{U_i}$", "MATH_0015": "$\\mathcal{S}_{U_i}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-stack-in-groupoids}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-gerbe}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:73bfe7580f06c32c58385e0436f8c9be2b5ac64fbb5db89874ac9a5eb995ccf6", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:bc656e49ed4001c731476e74f00df437f5c335ce8717cfad3e2d050c07cb5812", "source_text": "A <TEXTITOPEN_0001>gerbe<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> over a site <MATH_0001> is a category\n<MATH_0002> over <MATH_0003> such that\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0004> is a stack\nin groupoids over <MATH_0005> (see\nDefinition <REF_0001>),\n<STRUCT_0003> for <MATH_0006> there exists\na covering <MATH_0007> in <MATH_0008> such that\n<MATH_0009> is nonempty, and\n<STRUCT_0004> for <MATH_0010> and\n<MATH_0011> there exists\na covering <MATH_0012> in <MATH_0013> such that\n<MATH_0014> in <MATH_0015>.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:153537191ee84c91d33a797aa23d8180ce32757e2f38d4fd1131a657f81e2ac9", "unit_id": "tag:06NZ:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06NY", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0b63e8cd3c00e658c8b4ba9520ae0a1828ffe289c8b07ebce279305733e5848a", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIn other words, a gerbe is a stack in groupoids such that any two objects\nare locally isomorphic and such that objects exist locally.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:1c1601807635eac54418ef6023db933cdc3e6b566768c35ac9a970b592cb7e2d", "unit_id": "tag:06NY:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06NY", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{S}_1$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{S}_2$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{S}_1$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{S}_2$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{S}_1$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{S}_2$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{C}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-gerbe-equivalent}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7a06d8cecc2e4ffe3e65ef19e939456917e6e4d2d4b8b74b82b626d9d5802132", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:926f3989a510c7fe382194cf03f2b722729954157598b6b4a0a9d158d02672d3", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a site.\nLet <MATH_0002>, <MATH_0003> be categories over <MATH_0004>.\nSuppose that <MATH_0005> and <MATH_0006> are equivalent\nas categories over <MATH_0007>.\nThen <MATH_0008> is a gerbe over <MATH_0009> if and only if\n<MATH_0010> is a gerbe over <MATH_0011>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2da504462c187409d6ae51604fcf6fcfe32204b952c7a7656ea41700b250e7dc", "unit_id": "tag:06P0:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06NY", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{S}_1$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{S}_2$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0005": "$F : \\mathcal{S}_1 \\to \\mathcal{S}_2$", "MATH_0006": "$G : \\mathcal{S}_2 \\to \\mathcal{S}_1$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0008": "$U \\in \\Ob(\\mathcal{C})$", "MATH_0009": "$\\{U_i \\to U\\}$", "MATH_0010": "$(\\mathcal{S}_1)_{U_i}$", "MATH_0011": "$F$", "MATH_0012": "$(\\mathcal{S}_2)_{U_i}$", "MATH_0013": "$U \\in \\Ob(\\mathcal{C})$", "MATH_0014": "$x, y \\in \\Ob((\\mathcal{S}_2)_U)$", "MATH_0015": "$\\{U_i \\to U\\}$", "MATH_0016": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0017": "$G(x)|_{U_i} \\cong G(y)|_{U_i}$", "MATH_0018": "$(\\mathcal{S}_1)_{U_i}$", "MATH_0019": "$x|_{U_i} \\cong y|_{U_i}$", "MATH_0020": "$(\\mathcal{S}_2)_{U_i}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-stack-in-groupoids-equivalent}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{categories-lemma-equivalence-fibred-categories}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c90877b8037a063dbb3d1529d68e1b984a94cdb1af253c12d89e0358ad96864a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0921839c5619a50aa1d585c0ac8624068e2ba8901865db0ff4b161e954a6d994", "source_text": "Assume <MATH_0001> is a gerbe over <MATH_0002>. By\nLemma <REF_0001>\nwe see <MATH_0003> is a stack in groupoids over <MATH_0004>.\nLet <MATH_0005>,\n<MATH_0006> be equivalences of categories over\n<MATH_0007>. Given <MATH_0008> we see that there exists\na covering <MATH_0009> such that <MATH_0010> is\nnonempty. Applying <MATH_0011> we see that <MATH_0012> is nonempty.\nGiven <MATH_0013> and\n<MATH_0014> there exists\na covering <MATH_0015> in <MATH_0016> such that\n<MATH_0017> in <MATH_0018>. By\nCategories, Lemma <REF_0002>\nthis implies <MATH_0019> in <MATH_0020>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7bd2323bbe16e3acc3328cf20025af0b42ce4ea6cb077dd94352a6c51bd4e47c", "unit_id": "tag:06P0:proof"}
